  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.14 Federal Poverty Guidelines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.14 “Federal Poverty Guidelines” means the federal poverty guidelines updated periodically in the federal register by the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services under the authority of 42 U.S.C. §9909(2).\n\nSource. #13080, eff 9-14-20",
